1,"Maninkakan, Western Language (MLQ)... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/mlq/,"Western Maninkakan is a stable indigenous language of Senegal, the Gambia, and Mali. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family and is part of the Mandingo macrolanguage.","Maninkakan, Western",Niger-Congo
